title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[+ parlament_current_icv +] psc erc" data-summary="Majority government - [+ parlament_coalition_icv_psc_erc_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="color: var(--[+ parlament_current_icv +]); font-style: italic;">Alternative</span> <span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">Tripartite</span></span>
subtitle: [? if alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase = 1: The first round of government formation negotiations begins.?][? if alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase = 2: The parties enter the second round of government formation negotiations.?][? if alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase = 3: The third and final round of government formation negotiations begins.?]
tags: event
new-page: true
view-if: alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase > 0 and player_party == "erc"
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = false;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_vp = false;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_economy = false;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_interior = false;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_bnl = false;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_health = false;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage = Math.max(5, (Q.erc_parlament_s / Q.parlament_coalition_icv_psc_erc_s) * 55 + Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase * 3);

    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_expected_vp = Q.psc_parlament_s >= Q.erc_parlament_s ? "psc" : "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = Q.alternative_tripartite_expected_vp;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = Q.parlament_current_icv;

    var psc_claim = (Q.psc_parlament_s / Q.parlament_coalition_icv_psc_erc_s) * 55;
    if (Q.alternative_tripartite_expected_vp == "psc") {
        psc_claim -= 20;
    }
    if (psc_claim >= 10) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = "psc";
        psc_claim -= 10;
    }
    if (psc_claim >= 10) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = "psc";
        psc_claim -= 10;
    }
    if (psc_claim >= 7) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = "psc";
        psc_claim -= 7;
    }

    var erc_claim = Q.parlament_coalition_leverage;
    if (Q.alternative_tripartite_expected_vp == "erc") {
        erc_claim -= 20;
    }
    if (erc_claim >= 6) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = "erc";
        erc_claim -= 6;
    }
    if (erc_claim >= 5) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = "erc";
        erc_claim -= 5;
    }
    if (erc_claim >= 7) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = "erc";
        erc_claim -= 7;
    }
    if (Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase >= 2 && erc_claim >= 7) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = "erc";
        erc_claim -= 7;
    }
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage = Math.max(0, erc_claim);
    Q.alternative_tripartite_psc_economy_protected = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy == "psc";
    Q.alternative_tripartite_psc_interior_protected = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior == "psc";
    Q.alternative_tripartite_comuns_bnl_protected = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl == Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_comuns_health_protected = Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health == Q.parlament_current_icv;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_setnames
set-jump: choices
role: event

@choices

[+ parlament_current_icv +] has submitted its [? if alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase = 1: opening?][? if alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase > 1: revised?] cabinet proposal.

- @accept: Accept the current proposal
- @counterproposal

@counterproposal
title: [? if parlament_coalition_changes: Revisit our counter-proposal?][? if not parlament_coalition_changes: Draw a counter-proposal?]

- @claim_health: Demand the Health Ministry
- @claim_interior: Demand the Interior Ministry
- @claim_economy: Demand the Economy Ministry
- @claim_education: Demand the Education Ministry
- @claim_foreign: Demand the Foreign Affairs Ministry
- @claim_territory: Demand the Territory Ministry
- @claim_bnl: Demand the Business & Labour Ministry
- @send: Send the counter-proposal
- @choices: Review the current proposal

@claim_health
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 7 and parlament_coalition_proposal_health != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to add the Health Ministry to this proposal.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 7;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@claim_interior
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 10 and parlament_coalition_proposal_interior != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to claim the Interior Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 10;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@claim_economy
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 10 and parlament_coalition_proposal_economy != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to claim the Economy Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 10;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@claim_education
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 7 and parlament_coalition_proposal_education != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to claim the Education Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 7;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@claim_foreign
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 6 and parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to claim the Foreign Affairs Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 6;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@claim_territory
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 5 and parlament_coalition_proposal_territory != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to claim the Territory Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 5;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@claim_bnl
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 5 and parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl != "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the leverage to claim the Business & Labour Ministry.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_changes = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 5;
!}
go-to: counterproposal

@send
view-if: parlament_coalition_changes
on-arrival: {!
    var expectedVP = Q.psc_parlament_s >= Q.erc_parlament_s ? "psc" : "erc";
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_vp = Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase < 3 && expectedVP != "erc" && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp != expectedVP;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_economy = Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase == 1 && Q.alternative_tripartite_psc_economy_protected && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy != "psc";
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_interior = Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase < 3 && Q.alternative_tripartite_psc_interior_protected && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior != "psc";
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_bnl = Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase < 3 && Q.alternative_tripartite_comuns_bnl_protected && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl != Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_health = Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase < 3 && Q.alternative_tripartite_comuns_health_protected && Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health != Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_accept = !Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_vp && !Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_economy && !Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_interior && !Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_bnl && !Q.alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_health;
!}
go-to: accept if parlament_coalition_proposal_accept; revise

@revise
on-arrival: {!
    Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase += 1;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] -= 2;
    Q.psc_relations -= 1;
!}
go-to: new_elections if alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase > 3; post_event

The PSC and [+ parlament_current_icv +] have rejected our counter-proposal. [? if alternative_tripartite_reject_vp: The Vice-Presidency seems to remain a red line.?][? if alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_economy or alternative_tripartite_reject_psc_interior: The PSC remains dissatisfied with the balance of high-responsibility ministries.?][? if alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_bnl or alternative_tripartite_reject_comuns_health: [+ parlament_current_icv +] does not believe the proposal gives it sufficient influence over the government's social programme.?] The negotiating teams will reconvene.

@accept
choose-if: not parlament_coalition_changes
unavailable-subtitle: Our counter-proposal will require approval by both coalition partners.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase = 0;
    Q.erc_in_gob = true;
    Q.erc_supporting = true;
    Q.cup_in_gob = false;
    Q.cup_supporting = false;
    Q.position_disp = "Generalitat";
    Q.cat_coalition = [Q.parlament_current_icv, "psc", "erc"];
    Q.cat_coalition_support = [];
    Q.cat_coalition_abstain = [];
    Q.cat_coalition_disp = G.governmentTooltip("generalitat", Q.cat_coalition, "Majority government - " + Q.parlament_coalition_icv_psc_erc_s + "/" + Q.parlament_s_majority, "<span style='color: var(--" + Q.parlament_current_icv + "); font-style: italic;'>Alternative Tripartite</span>");
    Q.cat_coalition_dissent = 0;
!}

ERC and the PSC have accepted [+ parlament_current_icv +]'s proposal for a new coalition to take on the Generalitat.

- @parlament_coalition_resolve: A new government is formed

@new_elections
on-arrival: {!
    Q.alternative_tripartite_coalition_phase = 0;
    Q.parlament_repeat_election = true;
    Q.snap_blame = Q.player_party;
    Q.snap_counterparty = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    Q.snap_severity = 0.12;
!}
call: snap_election

The parties have exhausted the formation rounds without reaching an agreement...

- @post_event
